<title>EGYPT: Egypt over night, one week creates narrow.</title>
<headline>Egypt over night, one week creates narrow.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound narrowed on Monday to 7-1/2 and 8-1/4 percent from Sunday's range of 7-3/4 and 8-1/4 in a liquid private sector market, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates also narrowed to eight and 8-1/4 percent from 7-1/4 and 8-1/4 percent on Sunday, they added.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks kept their minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
